@baseUrl = https://ledger.home.example

### Process liveness (anonymous; does not prove database availability)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Database connectivity and applied migrations (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Interactive login (open this address in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login

### Session and antiforgery token (requires the owner's session cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session

### Ledger API rejects an unauthenticated request with 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts

### Authenticated logout without a verification token is rejected with 400
# With an authenticated cookie, supply the requestToken from /auth/session
# in X-CSRF-TOKEN to perform a successful logout.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
